actions.rationale:
Mod fixes:
- ladders move the climber by position: speed × the wall-clock time since the last tick, then velocity zeroed, which holds at any frame rate;
- the objective clock steps up to 3 s;
- the tanks have 4× health so they survive until the raiders arrive;
- debug.sets() shows or hides the set pieces for the frame-cost experiment.
Staging lint: 0 violations.
